    "created_at": "2016-11-11T22:35:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-11T22:35:02Z",
    "body": "The problem here is that there are name collisions between the members of the MessageEventInit dictionary and the attributes of the MessageEvent interface. Since the MessageEventInit dictionary comes last the dfns are finding that instead.\n\nPossible fixes are:\n1) split the IDL for MessageEvent and MessageEventInit with the dfns after the IDL for MessageEvent but before the IDL for MessageEventInit.\n2) add explicit data-dfn-type and data-dfn-for to the dfns for MessageEvent\n3) I change the parser to take the first hit instead of the last, but not sure what else this will break\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/260071517/reactions",
